      "content": "<div class=\"s-page-summary reset s-rte clearfix\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Monday</span></strong></p>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Run Christmas Present scenes</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Called: Scrooge, Present, Nephew, Ensemble, Niece, Jostlers, Cratchits and Chorus</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><strong>Tuesday</strong></div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Location: Cafeteria</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Run Christmas Future scenes</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Called: Christmas Future, Gentlemen, Old Joe and his crew, Scrooge</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><strong>Carolers called After School until 4:30 (Mr. Wilson's portable)</strong></div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><strong>Wednesday</strong></div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><span style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Run Christmas Past -&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><span style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Called: All characters in Act 1 including fezzywig and co and Carolers</span></div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><strong>Carolers called at 7:45 AM (mr wilson's room)</strong><br style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><br style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Refer to Schoology as well.</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><strong>Thursday</strong></div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Location: Cafeteria</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Continue Painting and repairing set</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Run Marley and Nephew</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Called: Scrooge, Marley, Nephew, Mr. Cratchits, Boy, Charity Gentlemen</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><strong>Friday</strong></div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Location Cafeteria</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\">Run Show - All called.</div>\n<div style=\"color:#3c4043;font-family:Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:#f1f3f4;\"><strong>Rehearsal will go until 6:00</strong></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>",
