      "title": "Show Week",
      "href": "https://roundrockisd.schoology.com/page/7615560036",
      "content": "<div class=\"s-page-summary reset s-rte clearfix\"><p dir=\"ltr\">December 2nd - 6th All cast, carolers, and crew called each day.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Bring snacks!</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Monday - Dry tech til 6 pm</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Where- Lecture hall (cast) and Cafeteria (crew)</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Tuesday- Tech til 6pm</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Cafeteria</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Wednesday - Dress rehearsal til 8:30 PM</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Thursday - Final dress til 8:30 PM</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Friday - Show #1.&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Dinner provided on Friday</p></div>",
