      "content": "<div class=\"s-page-summary reset s-rte clearfix\"><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Wednesday - Catch up rehearsal from 3:35 - 7pm...will release early if possible.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Friday - Performance @6pm Students stay through until show...we will feed Pizza.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Saturday - Final show.&nbsp; Call time is 4:30pm or 5pm if you are already in hair and makeup.&nbsp; We will not feed you this day...come fed and watered please.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Next week will have a cast party.</p></div>",
